window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Three full-length novels of filthy, forbidden romance....</b></p> <p><i>The Virgin and the Beast</i><br> Everything has its price, even virginity...and Xavier is willing to pay.</p> <p><i>Hurt So Good</i><br> It’s the single most forbidden of female fantasies. Most are ashamed to speak it out loud, much less ask for it, and usually so is Miranda...until Dylan Lennox comes along.</p> <p><i>Daddy’s Sweet Girl</i><br> Sarah gets a new step-father...and a new step-brother. Family ties have never been so twisted.</p> <p><i>Please note that these books are dark romances with intense scenes and include fantasies of dubious consent.</i></p>"; 
